From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 05:22:51 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 162/207] runner graph packet: max_ops 8192 (T1's call), so a
 32x32 edit distance fits one packet

The literal edit-distance DP is five bank ops per cell, so 32x32 needs 5,120 ops against the
packet's 4,096. Values stay at most 5,220, under the unchanged max_values (8192), so the
per-request value memory bound does not move; max_packet (1 MB) is unchanged and a 32x32 packet
is 618 KB. Measured on graph-v4: 32x32 in 55 ms, 5,124 steps. The offline verifier's generic
packet cap follows; named plans keep their 4,096 offline cap. Separate from the route so it can
be dropped if T1 objects (the route then stops at 819 cells).

(cherry picked from commit 97ddaaf01011a73f7eaf92a3a9e4fcbd0b8baa10)
---
 tools/runner_graph_verify.py         | 2 +-
 zig/src/core/runner_graph_packet.zig | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/runner_graph_verify.py b/tools/runner_graph_verify.py
index ba29e33d7997b1a7bf79670efe7ff85d22d88775..d29c64cb104796afabce448ab69e1b6a66a55ef9 100644
--- a/tools/runner_graph_verify.py
+++ b/tools/runner_graph_verify.py
@@ -114,7 +114,7 @@ def prepare_cases(cases, goldens, manifest, allow_generic):
             require(len(plans[packet["plan"]]["ops"]) <= 4096, f"plan exceeds operation cap: {row['id']}")
         else:
             require(allow_generic, f"main corpus requires named packets: {row['id']}")
-            require(len(packet.get("ops", [])) <= 4096, f"packet exceeds operation cap: {row['id']}")
+            require(len(packet.get("ops", [])) <= 8192, f"packet exceeds operation cap: {row['id']}")
         prepared.append({"id": row["id"], "packet": packet, "expected_output": expected})
     require(prepared, "empty corpus")
     return prepared
diff --git a/zig/src/core/runner_graph_packet.zig b/zig/src/core/runner_graph_packet.zig
index 66bf91c28c3be3534856877059d58477723dc909..0a24cf256a961fda7d9bf2f46dedb15760583213 100644
--- a/zig/src/core/runner_graph_packet.zig
+++ b/zig/src/core/runner_graph_packet.zig
@@ -2,7 +2,7 @@
 const std = @import("std");
 const Allocator = std.mem.Allocator;
 pub const max_packet = 1 << 20;
-pub const max_ops = 4096;
+pub const max_ops = 8192;
 pub const max_values = 8192;
 pub const max_arity = 16;
 pub const max_prints = 128;
